OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plan for tech to beat big
OL,4,Afreeze on roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the report before the
OL,7,Fcouncils' executive next week said a
OL,8,Fmore "targeted" approach could enable
OL,9,Fthe council to "use resources more
OL,10,Fefficiently" and use up to 15% less
OL,11,Fsalt.
